<title>UK: World Bank sets 15 bln Greek drachma Oct 2000 FRN.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 15 bln Greek drachma Oct 2000 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and IMI Lux.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN GDR    BASE     3M ATHIBOR    MATURITY 10.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     MINUS 90 BP PAY DATE S10.SEP.97  LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.344     FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    99.969	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON  LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 1-10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/GR  NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	   FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC  37.5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
